ic, far-commutation and braid relations of\nthe tower, with `q * qi = 1` closing the quadratic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.ocneanuMarkovTraceAt_g","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.ocneanuMarkovTraceAt_g","kind":"theorem","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L158-L159","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.ocneanuMarkovTraceAt_tr_ofLim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.ocneanuMarkovTraceAt_tr_ofLim","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L154-L156","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.ocneanuMarkovTraceAt_z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.ocneanuMarkovTraceAt_z","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L151-L152","doc":"The parameter of the colimit trace is the family's: nothing is chosen. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.ocneanuMarkovTraceAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.ocneanuMarkovTraceAt","kind":"def","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L131-L149","doc":"**The general-`z` Markov trace on the Hecke colimit.**  Any Markov trace\nfamily on the tower `Hecke K q qi n`, at any parameter `z`, packaged as an\n`OcneanuTrace.MarkovTrace` on the colimit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_markov_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_markov_inv","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L119-L127","doc":"**(T3')** Markov stabilisation by the inverse generator; `zinv = z - (q - qi)`\nis derived from `σ⁻¹ = σ - (q - qi)·1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_markov","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L105-L117","doc":"**(T3)** Markov stabilisation on the colimit, with the family's own `z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_one","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L99-L103","doc":"**(T2)** Normalisation on the colimit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_cyclic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_cyclic","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L89-L97","doc":"**(T1)** The trace property on the colimit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_ofLim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_ofLim","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L85-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L79-L83","doc":"The family's trace lifted to the colimit.  A `Module` lift: the level traces\nare linear and not multiplicative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_inclLE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.trFam_inclLE","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFamilyTrace.lean#L71-L77","doc":"The level-wise traces are compatible with the **iterated** inclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}